{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">理想汽車七月新車交付量超過3萬輛。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">按年跌近百分之1，按月跌超過百之1。累計今年首七個月，交付量接近22.4萬輛車，按年跌百分之4。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-03T02:19:06.907957+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":66,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}